{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#110", "es": "Hacerse a un lado{F801}Levantar el arma{F801}No moverse{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#111", "es": "〉 ¡{F843}{0000} esquiva al demonio!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#113", "es": "〉 El demonio te alcanza...{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#119", "es": "〉 El demonio te hace señas...{F801}¿Qué harás?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#120", "es": "Acercarse{F801}Responder con señas{F801}Levantar el arma{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#130", "es": "〉 El demonio intenta irse...{F801}¿Qué harás?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#139", "es": "〉 El demonio te ignora...{F801}¿Qué harás?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#141", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Déjame en paz!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#143", "es": "〉 {F843}{0000} baila una danza...{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#145", "es": "〉 {F843}{0000} baila una danza...{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#150", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Por favor, déjame ir!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#151", "es": "Perdonar{F801}No perdonar{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#164", "es": "“Exacto.”{F801}“Eso no es cierto.”{F801}“Soy un humano de confianza.”{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#172", "es": "{F871}{0100}Me interesan los humanos.{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#173", "es": "Amistosamente{F801}Con prepotencia{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#180", "es": "〉 El demonio está llorando.{F801}¿Qué harás?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#187", "es": "“Nop.”{F801}“Sí.”{F801}“Yo duermo cuando tengo sueño.”{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#219", "es": "“Nada.”{F801}“Dignidad.”{F801}“Al diablo con eso.”{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#224", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Guajajajajajaja! ¡Jajajajaja!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#225", "es": "〉 El demonio se retuerce de risa.{F801}¿Qué harás?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#251", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Tú! ¡Inclínate!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#252", "es": "〉 El demonio te mira fijamente.{F801}¿Qué harás?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#259", "es": "“Recógelo tú.”{F801}“No hay nada ahí.”{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#274", "es": "{F871}{0100}¿Qué me vas a dar?{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#275", "es": "Darle dulces{F801}Darle agua{F801}Darle licor{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#286", "es": "“Te mataré.”{F801}“No te mataré.”{F801}“¿Qué debería hacer?”{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#292", "es": "“Es mentira.”{F801}“Es la verdad.”{F801}“Es mentira de verdad.”{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#383", "es": "{F871}{0100}¡Quiero tener un amigo humano! Ahora, ¡démonos la mano para mostrar nuestra amistad!{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#384", "es": "Darle la mano{F801}Dejar la mano en el aire{F801}Ponerse una tachuela en la mano{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
{"key": "battle/talk/TalkToneUnknown.mbm#385", "es": "{F871}{0100}Guau, qué agarre...{F801}No quiero pelear con ese sujeto.{F801}{F802}{FFFF}"}
